From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:07:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s image: kernel v272-23 and firmware j714s16-4 (mics,
 Wi-Fi power save, sleep driver)

Re-pinned from betizzel/omarchy-m5:
- linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora17.v272-23 (413a9018..., 44954844 bytes) from
  ea5cac9: v272-21 plus CONFIG_APPLE_SOC_SLEEP=y and patch 0012 (the sleep
  driver admits the 15-core J714s). Booted on the J714s 2026-11-27; s2idle
  with lid wake checked. The qualification pins follow 7.3.0-17.v272-23-ARCH.
- omarchy-aurora-firmware 20261014.j714s16-4 (28e32daf..., from 165752a):
  the J714 mic graph on the HPAI card (asahi-audio #45), Wi-Fi power save on,
  and s2idle kept as the default sleep (deep sleep leaves the PMP down).
Nothing else changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
